[h2]Fixed: the mystical orbs that uber monsters drop can now pay every weapon class, spears included[/h2]

[b]The orbs had the same hole the chests did.[/b] Every uber monster's mystical orb rolled its weapons from a list that covered axes, clubs, swords, bows and staves and quietly left out spears. A spear of any quality was impossible out of 15 of the 18 orb loot tables, on every difficulty. The chest half of this was fixed in an earlier update; this is the other half of the loot economy.

[list]
[*][b]Every orb tier now draws from the full weapon set.[/b] Axe, club, sword, bow, staff and spear, at the orb's own difficulty. Spears go from zero reachable to 18 on Normal, 9 on Epic and 22 on Legendary out of every orb tier.
[*][b]More distinct items reachable per orb.[/b] Tier by tier on Legendary: 194 to 260, 138 to 241, 196 to 262, 258 to 308. The Toxeus apex orb was already correct and is unchanged.
[*][b]The weapon and shield rows fire more often.[/b] Weapons go from about 13 percent to 40 percent and shields from about 13 percent to 30 percent, which are the rates the Toxeus apex orb has used since the chest update. The whole ladder now behaves the same way.
[*][b]Nothing was taken away.[/b] The spawn count equations, gold, relic row, potion row, both armour rows and the apex orb's larger payout are byte for byte what they were. No entry was removed from any orb and no drop rate was lowered.
[*][b]Normal difficulty stays Normal.[/b] The difficulty an orb is opened on decides which item tier it can pay, so no legendary gear appears on Normal.
[*][b]A permanent gate so it cannot come back.[/b] The build now fails loudly if any uber orb stops being able to pay a weapon class, if a pool collapses, or if a new uber quietly drags an unrelated loot table into the sweep.
[/list]

[i]This update changes loot tables only. No stat, skill, monster, quest or map was touched. The portal page cap, the Epic and Legendary soul names, the Boar Snatcher orb, the Spartan Crypt entrance and the chest breadth work from the previous updates are all included.[/i]
